    "minimax_h3": {
      "_note": "Minimax H3 video/audio DiT, matched against Abiray's Minimax-H3-nvfp4-INT4-INT8-Convrot reference dumps. Only norms, token_refiner, time_embedder, condition_proj, patch projections, final_layer's norm/video_out/audio_out, and final_layer.adaln_proj.linear specifically stay unquantized -- block-level adaln_proj.linear is NOT blacklisted here so it quantizes normally under int4_tensorwise (matching the reference non-pruned file, where it's INT4 like every other block GEMM). force_int8_layers still routes block-level adaln_proj.linear to plain INT8 under int8_convrot/int4_convrot specifically (see code: force_int8 is skipped for int4_tensorwise targets), since ConvRot's groupsize (256) doesn't divide 2688. final_layer.adaln_proj.linear is blacklisted explicitly (not caught by force_int8_layers, since blacklist is checked first) -- reference dump shows it BF16-untouched in both pruned and non-pruned files. For *_pruned target formats, pruned_extra_blacklist additionally excludes block-level adaln_proj.linear and adaln_t_table, since the pruned architecture replaces that projection with a rank-8 timestep lookup table this converter does not (yet) synthesize -- do not use *_pruned formats on this profile until that reconstruction is implemented.",
